[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS022
TITLE: Record the UID that authorized a decision
STATEMENT: >>>
The aircraft shall append an in-memory decision record for each accepted clearance, refusal, link-down transition, garble response, blocked repeat, emergency declaration, and automatic phase change. The record shall name the requirement UID and a one-line summary. A step that does not change phase shall not add a record. The log shall not be written to disk. Acceptance is a takeoff sequence whose log contains AC-SRS021 after a phase change, and an Unable decision whose log contains AC-SRS016.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The log is the in-memory trace from a decision back to a requirement.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
